# U34: DeleteItem (allflame_exp_001). Select the third item list row (a jewel in Socket #10) and
# press DELETE (U32's OnSelDelete: the confirm popup, RETURN): DeleteItem clears the socket slot
# and `spec.jewels`, deallocates the socket node and its `depends` (a recalc), PopulateSlots,
# AddUndoState; snapshot; "Del Unused" (DeleteItem with deferUndoState for every item no slot,
# abyssal socket or tree uses, then the cluster graphs, PopulateSlots, AddUndoState), snapshot;
# Ctrl+Z twice (the deleted items, the slots and the item order come back; the tree keeps its
# deallocated nodes, which the spec's own undo buffer holds), snapshot.
#! u34-expect currently equipped in Socket #10
#! u34-expect undo: 2 redo: 0 mod: true
#! u34-expect undo: 3 redo: 0 mod: true
#! u34-expect undo: 1 redo: 2 mod: true
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press 3
key-up CTRL
frames 3
move 800 102
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
press DELETE
frames 2
press RETURN
frames 3
snapshot deleted
move 940 48
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
snapshot unused
move 1200 700
frames 1
key-down CTRL
press z
key-up CTRL
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press z
key-up CTRL
frames 3
snapshot undone
